2026-04-02T23:36:00 — FIXED: long rest spell slot restoration at 0 HP
  Quint's doLongRest restores spell slots unconditionally (pInitSpellSlots runs
  regardless of HP), but only restores creature state if alive. XState's
  longRestUpdate returned {} when hp < 1, skipping slot restoration entirely.
  Fix: slot restoration is now unconditional; only hp/exhaustion/hitDice gated on alive.
  This also fixes the arcaneRecoveryUsed and pactSlotsCurrent runtime divergences
  (both were downstream of slots not being restored after dying and resting).
  Fuzzers restarted.

